# Frontend — Next.js 14 Aid Desk

## Routes (Tier A)

| Route | Required UI |
|-------|-------------|
| `/chat` | Input, Urdu sample chips, **AgentTrace** streaming sidebar |
| `/tickets` | Status badges, expandable agent trace |
| `/supervisor` | Pending queue, approve/reject + note |
| `/dashboard` | cases today, avg time-to-ticket, escalation % |

## Agent trace

**Visible on every chat run** — key judge/demo moment. Stream from SSE `/api/v1/chat`.

Show agent name, action, timestamp per step.

## API client

`frontend/lib/api.ts` — base URL from `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`.

## Tier scope

Tier A UI first. Tier B (role-based layouts, RAG citations UI) only after Tier A complete.

## Style

Professional ops desk — not consumer chat bubble toy. Clear status, tables, metrics cards.
